<Legal title="Privacy notice">
  <h2>What we keep</h2>
  <p>
    Your username, a scrambled (hashed) version of your password, the groups you belong to and the
    quotes and context you add. We do not ask for your email address, real name or phone number.
  </p>

  <h2>Why</h2>
  <p>Only to run the app for you and your friends: to log you in and to show your group its quotes.</p>

  <h2>Who can see it</h2>
  <p>
    Members of a group can see that group's quotes. The operator can technically access the stored
    data in order to run the service.
  </p>

  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>
    džingel uses no analytics, advertising, external fonts or tracking. Your quotes are not sent to
    other companies. It uses a single cookie to keep you logged in.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    Ask the operator (see the contact at the top of this page) to see, correct or delete your data.
  </p>

  <p>See also the <a href="/terms">Terms and Conditions</a>.</p>
</Legal>
